sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant API as BookingController
    participant S as BookingService
    participant P as BookingPolicy
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    C->>API: POST /api/v1/bookings
    API->>API: Bean Validation (shape: ids, names, seat numbers present)
    API->>S: createBooking(command)
    S->>S: BookingRequestValidator<br/>(1..9 passengers, normalise seats, format, duplicates)
    S->>DB: BEGIN
    S->>DB: SELECT flight_instance ... FOR UPDATE
    Note over S,DB: Writes on this flight are now serialised.<br/>Other flights are unaffected.
    S->>DB: expireHolds(instance, now): overdue HELD -> EXPIRED,<br/>seats RELEASED, available_seats restored<br/>(skipped when the seat hold is off)
    S->>S: flight not departed? inside the booking window?<br/>seats exist in SeatLayout?
    S->>DB: takenSeats(flight): seat_number FROM booking_seat<br/>WHERE status IN (ACTIVE, HELD) [HELD only while the hold is live]
    S->>S: requested seats ∩ taken seats
    alt any requested seat taken
        S->>DB: ROLLBACK
        S-->>API: SeatUnavailableException(seats)
        API-->>C: 409 SEAT_UNAVAILABLE + unavailableSeats
    else all seats free
        S->>P: newBooking(...)
        P-->>S: CONFIRMED + ACTIVE seats<br/>(or HELD + HELD seats, expires now + ttl)
        S->>DB: INSERT booking, booking_seat rows (flush)
        S->>DB: UPDATE flight_instance SET available_seats = available_seats - n
        S->>DB: COMMIT
        S-->>API: BookingResult
        API-->>C: 201 Created + Location
    end
